# Spinner semantics

While a source is `indexing`, the spinner uses that document's `effort` — not a blanket `spin.intense`.

| Effort | Token | Meaning |
| heavy commentary / thinking | `spin.deep` | takes longer to reason |
| case law / clarifying | `spin.moderate` | steady read |
| statute / index scan | `spin.intense` | quick |

- Hold a token for about one revolution so the speed is readable.
- Change speed with `useSmoothedSpin` (attack fast, release slow). Never restart CSS `animation-duration` mid-spin.
- Keep the file being read in the visible pill row so tempo matches a pill.
- Reduced motion: freeze rotation.
